error: `Directory.list` holds the thread until it is done, and an async function does not hold its thread
  `Directory.list` waits for the disk
  the tasks of async functions share a few threads: one that holds its thread keeps the others from running
  --> error_async_directory_list.sg:3:33
 3 |     var entries = try Directory.list(read path)
   |                                 ^^^^
  hint: `await Directory.listAsync(read path)` does the same work without holding the thread
